{"seq":32,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1232"},"reason":"Extended the feeding passage (the twelve baskets read as the tribes of Israel; the second feeding with seven baskets) so the new question about the leftovers is properly set in context.","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",858],["-","afterwards."],["+","afterwards,"],["=",1],["+","one, as old interpreters noted, for each tribe of Israel. Matthew and Mark add a second feeding, of four thousand with seven loaves, after which seven baskets were left. "],["=",221]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",806],["-","eingesammelt."],["+","eingesammelt,"],["=",1],["+","nach alter Deutung einer für jeden Stamm Israels. Matthäus und Markus berichten zudem von einer zweiten Speisung, der von viertausend mit sieben Broten, nach der sieben Körbe übrig blieben. "],["=",213]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",756],["-","остатков."],["+","остатков,"],["=",1],["+","по давнему толкованию — по одному на каждое колено Израилево. Матфей и Марк рассказывают ещё и о втором насыщении — четырёх тысяч семью хлебами, после которого осталось семь корзин. "],["=",223]]}],"hash":"77a86692e8d0"},
{"seq":33,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28403"},"reason":"New question added to grow the article from five to six facts: How many baskets of leftovers were gathered after Jesus had fed the five thousand with five loaves and two fish? (answer: twelve baskets), verified against the cited sources.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Feeding_the_multitude"},{"url":"https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Mark+6%3A43&version=NRSVUE"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"twelve baskets"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"zwölf Körbe"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"двенадцать коробов"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[2286,14],"de":[2468,11],"ru":[2308,18]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"creation","start":"70","end":null,"precision":"year","approx":true,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"Mark's Gospel, with the earliest account of the feeding of the five thousand, is written","labelDe":"Das Markusevangelium mit dem ältesten Bericht von der Speisung der Fünftausend entsteht","labelRu":"Написано Евангелие от Марка с древнейшим рассказом о насыщении пяти тысяч"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Feeding_the_multitude","title":"Feeding the multitude – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"8c9001fe4a31"},
